sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User A
    participant EP as BlockEndpoints
    participant BS as BlockService
    participant DB as AppDbContext / PostgreSQL

    U->>EP: POST /api/users/{username}/block
    EP->>BS: BlockAsync(A, B)

    alt A == B
        BS-->>EP: throws SelfBlockException
        EP-->>U: 400
    else different users
        BS->>DB: upsert UserBlock(A, B) — idempotent
        EP-->>U: 200
    end

    Note over BS,DB: Existing conversations are NOT deleted.<br/>ConversationService/MessageService re-check<br/>IsBlockedEitherWayAsync on next create/send<br/>(see 15-messaging-flow.md)
